test.tsx:8:57: `styled()` cannot compile here on React Native: a function of the props gives style props, which React Native cannot read at runtime. Fix: return what `css()` gives, or write each value as a function of the props
test.tsx:9:18: `styled()` cannot compile here on React Native: the build compiles `styled()` called with a component and its styles. Fix: write `styled(Target)({ ... })`, `` styled(Target)`...` `` or `styled(Target, { ... })`
test.tsx:10:18: `styled` can only be called on React Native: the build compiles each call into styles. Fix: call it where the styles are used
